          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 48.06,
          "en": "But I'll add any extra dependencies which I have here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.06,
          "end": 51.9,
          "en": "by simply pasting them in here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.9,
          "end": 54.66,
          "en": "And I can then simply remove any duplicates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 56.7,
          "en": "I might have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.7,
          "end": 60.03,
          "en": "There should be no difference for the dev dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.03,
          "end": 60.96,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.96,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "we prepared this project for deployment to Netlify.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.82,
          "end": 68.31,
          "en": "Now in order to deploy it now, we then have to go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.31,
          "end": 72.42,
          "en": "to the Netlify website and create an account there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.42,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "Now you could log in with GitHub",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 77.7,
          "en": "up or create a new account with email and password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 80.67,
          "en": "and I'll actually choose GitHub here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.67,
          "end": 82.577,
          "en": "But for that, I'll first of all create a new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.577,
          "end": 85.11,
          "en": "GitHub account where I wanna host my",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 86.64,
          "en": "Netlify project anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 88.98,
          "en": "So this project which I wanna deploy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.98,
          "end": 90.977,
          "en": "because we'll then link Netlify to GitHub",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.977,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "so that Netlify can pull the code from GitHub.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 98.1,
          "en": "So therefore here I'll quickly create a GitHub account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.1,
          "end": 100.59,
          "en": "And of course you can also use an existing one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.59,
          "end": 102.18,
          "en": "And then here in my account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.18,
          "end": 105.57,
          "en": "I'll simply create a new repository",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.57,
          "end": 107.61,
          "en": "in my case here, a private one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.61,
          "end": 112.1,
          "en": "which I'll name remix Netlify example, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 117.87,
          "en": "And I'll then connect this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.87,
          "end": 121.68,
          "en": "to my local project and push my code to GitHub.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.68,
          "end": 123.87,
          "en": "Now, I'll not show all the details of how that works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.87,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "since this is not a GitHub course, but in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.87,
          "end": 129.21,
          "en": "you simply need to add this repository",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.21,
          "end": 132.21,
          "en": "as a remote repository to your project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.21,
          "end": 134.793,
          "en": "and then push your code to GitHub.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.32999999999998,
          "end": 140.82,
          "en": "With that done, I got my code on GitHub",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.82,
          "end": 142.62,
          "en": "which is an important prerequisite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 145.86,
          "en": "to connecting it to Netlify and to ensuring that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.86,
          "end": 148.35,
          "en": "Netlify gets access to this code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.35,
          "end": 151.18,
          "en": "And I can now log into Netlify here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 154.683,
          "en": "with my GitHub account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.192,
          "end": 159.81,
          "en": "Authorize Netlify to access my account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 163.383,
          "en": "and then import a project from GitHub.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.43,
          "end": 170.46,
          "en": "And here after authorizing Netlify again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.46,
          "end": 173.28,
          "en": "I'll select this repository which I just added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.28,
          "end": 174.9,
          "en": "which contains my code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.9,
          "end": 177.723,
          "en": "And I'll in the end link it to Netlify here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.78,
          "end": 182.85,
          "en": "Now, here I wanna deploy the main branch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.85,
          "end": 184.51,
          "en": "so the code in the main branch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.37,
          "end": 189.27,
          "en": "and it automatically detects that this is a remix project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.27,
          "end": 192.99,
          "en": "and therefore understands how to build that project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.99,
          "end": 194.79,
          "en": "and how to then serve all the files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.79,
          "end": 197.373,
          "en": "And therefore then we can click deploy site.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.29,
          "end": 204,
          "en": "And now this project is being built and deployed by Netlify.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204,
          "end": 207.39,
          "en": "However, right now this is not all we have to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.39,
          "end": 212.39,
          "en": "Instead, we also have to log into our MongoDB account again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.91,
          "end": 216.36,
          "en": "because since our application will now soon be served",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216.36,
          "end": 220.77,
          "en": "by Netlify servers we also must allow those servers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.77,
          "end": 222.72,
          "en": "to connect to our databases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.72,
          "end": 224.91,
          "en": "And for that, under network access,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.91,
          "end": 229.44,
          "en": "we also have to allow access from anywhere to our database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.44,
          "end": 231.93,
          "en": "not just from our local IP.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 231.93,
          "end": 235.02,
          "en": "Otherwise connection attempts from our application running",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 237.66,
          "en": "on the Netlify servers will fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.66,
          "end": 239.94,
          "en": "And we of course don't want that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.94,
          "end": 243.03,
          "en": "So therefore, now with that being update, if I go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 243.03,
          "end": 246.51,
          "en": "to Netlify and reload, it looks like the app was deployed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.51,
          "end": 248.1,
          "en": "I also get a link here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 248.1,
          "end": 250.77100000000002,
          "en": "You can of course also add your own domain if you want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.77100000000002,
          "end": 253.57,
          "en": "but here I get an automatically generated domain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 254.76,
          "end": 259.62,
          "en": "and I get an error regarding prisma not being initialized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.62,
          "end": 263.01,
          "en": "The reason for that is that prisma needs to run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 263.01,
          "end": 266.88,
          "en": "this command to build this package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 266.88,
          "end": 269.58299999999997,
          "en": "which we use in our code to interact with prisma.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.66,
          "end": 273.54,
          "en": "To fix this, we should go back to our project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.54,
          "end": 276.42,
          "en": "to this Netlify remix project, which we created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 276.42,
          "end": 280.08,
          "en": "And there in this Netlify.toml which you have in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 280.08,
          "end": 283.56,
          "en": "change this build command here, from remix build,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 283.56,
          "end": 287.19,
          "en": "to npx prisma generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.19,
          "end": 289.05,
          "en": "and and remix build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 289.05,
          "end": 291.15,
          "en": "so that this command will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291.15,
          "end": 292.59000000000003,
          "en": "before we trigger the build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.59000000000003,
          "end": 295.47,
          "en": "Because this command will then generate the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 295.47,
          "end": 300.33,
          "en": "prisma package that's needed by our code to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 300.33,
          "end": 303.513,
          "en": "With that done, we can add and create a new commit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 304.92,
          "end": 306.51,
          "en": "But before we push this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 306.51,
          "end": 309.603,
          "en": "we also have to change something back there on Netlify.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 311.55,
          "end": 315.24,
          "en": "There you should go to site, settings, and then there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 315.24,
          "end": 318.58,
          "en": "scroll down all the way to environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 319.86,
          "end": 322.05,
          "en": "and there click on added variables,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 322.05,
          "end": 324.57,
          "en": "under environment variables.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 324.57,
          "end": 326.88,
          "en": "And there are two environment variables which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 326.88,
          "end": 329.28,
          "en": "we've been using in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 329.28,
          "end": 332.22,
          "en": "We must set them here for production as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 332.22,
          "end": 334.44,
          "en": "We must add the database URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 334.44,
          "end": 337.5,
          "en": "and send it to the same URL as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 337.5,
          "end": 341.88,
          "en": "Of course, we could also use a different user and password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 341.88,
          "end": 345.87,
          "en": "if we had different users and passwords set up on MongoDB",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 345.87,
          "end": 348.933,
          "en": "but we must have a valid connection URL here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 350.90999999999997,
          "end": 353.73,
          "en": "And we also must specify the session secret.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 353.73,
          "end": 356.90999999999997,
          "en": "Otherwise, our code will crash when we try to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 356.90999999999997,
          "end": 358.53,
          "en": "with sessions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 358.53,
          "end": 360.45,
          "en": "And here this should be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 360.45,
          "end": 364.413,
          "en": "to some secure value and that should be saved as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 365.25,
          "end": 367.53,
          "en": "So that's another important thing we have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 367.53,
          "end": 370.44,
          "en": "besides editing this build command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 370.44,
          "end": 373.08,
          "en": "So now that the environment variables were updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 373.08,
          "end": 375.54,
          "en": "we should push our updated code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 375.54,
          "end": 379.2,
          "en": "And since Netlify is linked to our GitHub repository,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 379.2,
          "end": 382.65,
          "en": "this will automatically trigger a new deployment process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 382.65,
          "end": 384.96,
          "en": "We can see this here under deploys",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 384.96,
          "end": 386.763,
          "en": "and this time this should succeed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 388.2,
          "end": 391.5,
          "en": "So now that this new deployment process finished",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 391.5,
          "end": 395.31,
          "en": "we can visit this website again, and this looks much better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 395.31,
          "end": 397.02,
          "en": "That's our website up and running.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 397.02,
          "end": 398.79,
          "en": "We can navigate around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 398.79,
          "end": 402.27,
          "en": "We can also log in all with our existing users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 402.27,
          "end": 404.52,
          "en": "because we're still using the same database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 404.52,
          "end": 409.02,
          "en": "So these users still exist, the expenses still exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 409.02,
          "end": 411.42,
          "en": "Of course, we can delete them though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 411.42,
          "end": 413.94,
          "en": "We can add new expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 413.94,
          "end": 416.79,
          "en": "and we can do all the things we did throughout this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 416.79,
          "end": 420.09,
          "en": "But now in our deployed remix application here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
